fixed word b, free word a: H is a polynomial of degree <= 2 in the bits of a; c_ij(b) = d_i d_j H.
  n = 3: largest set of a-bits with all c_ij(b) = 0, over all b: 1 (b = 000, positions [1]); every c_ij(b) <= 0: True
  n = 4: largest set of a-bits with all c_ij(b) = 0, over all b: 1 (b = 0000, positions [1]); every c_ij(b) <= 0: True
  n = 5: largest set of a-bits with all c_ij(b) = 0, over all b: 1 (b = 00000, positions [1]); every c_ij(b) <= 0: True
  n = 6: largest set of a-bits with all c_ij(b) = 0, over all b: 1 (b = 000000, positions [1]); every c_ij(b) <= 0: True
  n = 7: largest set of a-bits with all c_ij(b) = 0, over all b: 1 (b = 0000000, positions [1]); every c_ij(b) <= 0: True
